solution:
Draw a line segment from $A$ to $B,$ cutting the shaded diamond region in half. Next, draw the altitude from point $E$ to segment $AB.$ The new figure is shown below: [asy]
draw((0,0)--(10,0));
draw((10,0)--(10,10));
draw((10,10)--(0,10));
draw((0,0)--(0,10));
draw((0,0)--(5,10));
draw((5,10)--(10,0));
draw((0,10)--(5,0));
draw((5,0)--(10,10));
